      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TESTING ONE TWO (1) returned with a solid minor placings at Balaklava on June 26 but failed last time in a run that was too bad to be true. Has been freshened with a month between runs and rates on top on his peak figures. Worth forgiving. OUR DIVINYL (3) showed good early dash and led for much of the way before weakening out of it in time. Fair bit easier this time and should be tough to rein in. UNCLE BARRY (2) finished third two runs back at this track then improved last time out to score dominantly as public elect over 1000m at Roxby Downs. Stepping up a level this time but on current form he is one of the chief contenders. THE HASS (7) was much better third-up at Balaklava in testing conditions when sticking on gamely into the placings. Easier this time and draws well. Can play a role with fresh legs off 39 days. FINNBAR MCCOOL (4) got off the mark in style at Roxby Downs last time. Tougher this time but has upside.",
